    "name": "AI Factory Large Scale Access",
    "description": "Access for industrial AI applications that need large allocations, continuously open with two cut-offs a month. Proposals are evaluated together after each cut-off: administrative check, technical assessment and Industrial Innovation Group evaluation per AI Factory, the adoption of the ranking lists, and the allocation decision before the applicant accepts the award.",
